{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t廣州《羊城晚報》報道，中央近日批准馮忠華出任廣東省委副書記。<br/>\n<br/>\n現年56歲的馮忠華是遼寧丹東人，早年先後在原建設部、住建部工作，其後出任海南省委常委、組織部部長和副省長，2024年調往廣東工作，擔任廣東省委常委、組織部部長、廣州市委書記等職務。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T07:23:57.591671+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T06:51:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T02:07:36.197871+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T07:17:24.344182+00:00","content_hash":"e67375ff880e15614d1d4719782293c56cb4ec6488d490b123d28f16571df617","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}